{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20374",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.89,
      "end_seconds": 5.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "right, hi, is it okay to come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.64,
      "end_seconds": 10.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.37,
      "end_seconds": 15.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "I've, I've been losing weight without trying."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.66,
      "end_seconds": 20.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "how long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.39,
      "end_seconds": 26.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Actually, it's been going on for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.92,
      "end_seconds": 30.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.3,
      "end_seconds": 41.9,
      "duration_seconds": 9.6,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get night sweats as well. The night sweats? That's been for six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.85,
      "end_seconds": 47.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "how troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.7,
      "end_seconds": 50.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "It's moderate, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.41,
      "end_seconds": 53.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "anything that improves it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.06,
      "end_seconds": 61.5,
      "duration_seconds": 6.44,
      "text": "Mm, um, I get some relief from changing the sheets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.9,
      "end_seconds": 75.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "Did you get bone pain, vomiting or coughing up blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.76,
      "end_seconds": 93.06,
      "duration_seconds": 16.3,
      "text": "Actually, no, no bone pain, no vomiting, no coughing up blood. I did have a dry cough at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.33,
      "end_seconds": 99.68,
      "duration_seconds": 6.35,
      "text": "I follow. Right, and what about blood in the stool, difficulty swallowing or itching?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.27,
      "end_seconds": 102.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "no, none that I've noticed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.77,
      "end_seconds": 106.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.01,
      "end_seconds": 108.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "Nothing odd there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.53,
      "end_seconds": 113.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.72,
      "end_seconds": 118.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.19,
      "end_seconds": 123.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.77,
      "end_seconds": 131.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Actually, I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.73,
      "end_seconds": 137.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.65,
      "end_seconds": 148.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.32,
      "text": "Okay, so I'm on losartan, 50 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 150.08,
      "end_seconds": 155.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 100 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.73,
      "end_seconds": 160.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "Hm. Do you have the the latest prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.13,
      "end_seconds": 172.38,
      "duration_seconds": 11.25,
      "text": "Uh, you know, no, I left it at home. Rosuvastatin. I take it 10 milligrams, maybe, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.94,
      "end_seconds": 177.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.0,
      "end_seconds": 193.88,
      "duration_seconds": 14.88,
      "text": "Erm, uh, no, it's at home. Hydrocortisone cream. I take it when needed. I, I'd been on valsartan, not any more though, I stopped."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.2,
      "end_seconds": 197.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.14,
      "end_seconds": 203.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "I mean, I have high blood pressure, for two years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.05,
      "end_seconds": 205.75,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.9,
      "end_seconds": 228.78,
      "duration_seconds": 17.88,
      "text": "High cholesterol, for five years. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it. I've had eczema for nearly five years now. I've had acid reflux for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.78,
      "end_seconds": 236.93,
      "duration_seconds": 7.15,
      "text": "Right, so high blood pressure is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 238.65,
      "end_seconds": 246.99,
      "duration_seconds": 8.34,
      "text": "doctor, I've got the the readings for you. Temperature 36.8, heart rate 75. Saturation 98 percent, blood pressure 128 over 81."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.53,
      "end_seconds": 248.23,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.83,
      "end_seconds": 275.47,
      "duration_seconds": 13.64,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression from what you've said is this: I'd lean towards an unexplained weight loss that needs a proper work-up. I can't rule out a chronic infection yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 276.6,
      "end_seconds": 279.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.59,
      "end_seconds": 294.93,
      "duration_seconds": 14.34,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with an unexplained weight loss that needs a proper work-up do well once it's treated properly i'll request blood tests, it'll help with weight loss"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 296.67,
      "end_seconds": 299.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "The earliest is Wednesday, 9 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.99,
      "end_seconds": 321.61,
      "duration_seconds": 20.62,
      "text": "Let's book a chest X-ray to look into cough and weight loss. Weigh yourself once a week at the same time and note it down. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.58,
      "end_seconds": 325.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    }
  ]
}